WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,580
Your strong brother came out to hang out when he was a teenager

2
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,820
If he doesn't recognize something

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,980
That proves that no one here wants brothers.

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,460
Sister-in-law, tell you the truth

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,300
Even if this thing is really not a Buddha's hand

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,420
But here as long as no one knows us

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,700
No one recognizes his value

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,220
You can only sell it as a Buddha's hand

9
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,500
My sister-in-law knows that I want to put it in my hands

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,620
These things sell for a high price

11
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,940
Remind me to be pragmatic again

12
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,660
But this is me climbing a dangerous rock after all.

13
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,900
It took a lot of hard work to get it, but it was sold.

14
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,020
I would rather take it home and eat it myself

15
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:29,460
Let the whole family try something fresh. Sister-in-law sells it as Buddha's hand.

16
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,700
The Buddha's hand is not worth much even if it is sold.

17
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:37,470
I'd better take it back and eat it myself, brother.

18
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:38,630
Be careful on the road

19
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:41,260
The port closures have not been peaceful in recent years.

20
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:46,140
Got it, Brother Qiang

21
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:50,270
Something's wrong

22
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:51,630
This is for me

23
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:53,070
It seems that we have returned home with a full load three times in a row.

24
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,230
I've been targeted

25
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:55,270
Once on the boat

26
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:57,390
It’s to the vast sea that these people will search

27
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,750
Take the right opportunity

28
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:01,270
We can't take the risk of sailing today, right?

29
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:03,110
It should be said that before thinking of ways to protect yourself

30
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:05,790
It's better not to go to sea again

31
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:07,470
Although it is very important to be in the team

32
00:01:07,470 --> 00:01:08,630
Life is more important
